@head
@char 233
@cycle 2
@p1 range;Intelligence?
@p2 range;Deviance?
' p1 intel  p2 deviance  p3 follower id  p4 leader id
' p5 stepx  p6 stepy  (not element step -- aftertick would walk those)
' p7 p8 cursor cell during drag  p9 p10 scratch
' p4 is scratch during this tick; a finished move clears it
:think
#if thisx is playerx and (random 0 9) below p1 do
